WEBVTT

00:11.420 --> 00:13.130
<b>Why did you try to abduct this woman?</b>

00:13.590 --> 00:15.800
<b>You an Agent? Answer me!</b>

00:16.550 --> 00:17.550
<b>Agent?</b>

00:18.890 --> 00:20.060
<b>Eyes on the target.</b>

00:20.140 --> 00:22.640
<b>She’s with a local
and that Resistance Agent.</b>

00:22.980 --> 00:24.140
<b><i>I want the woman alive...</i></b>

00:24.560 --> 00:25.810
<b><i>The other two dead.</i></b>

00:25.900 --> 00:28.570
<b><i>Do whatever’s necessary.</i></b>

00:28.650 --> 00:29.480
<b>Roger!</b>

00:41.910 --> 00:42.750
<b>The hell?</b>

00:47.210 --> 00:48.040
<b>Get up!</b>

00:50.420 --> 00:52.010
<b>-Grab the girl!
-Right away!</b>

00:53.590 --> 00:55.590
<b>I see the Agent at three o’clock. Get him!</b>

00:55.680 --> 00:57.510
<b>-Don't let the target escape!
-I got you!</b>

01:03.730 --> 01:05.480
<b><i>Control Field established.</i></b>

01:51.230 --> 01:52.270
<b>How’s he doing that?</b>

01:56.690 --> 01:57.860
<b>He’s a Sensitive.</b>

02:01.990 --> 02:02.830
<b>Let’s go.</b>

02:20.510 --> 02:25.140
<b><i>Welcome back, Agent.</i>
<i>I was getting worried about you.</i></b>

03:59.610 --> 04:00.990
<b>What’s with that dude?</b>

04:04.950 --> 04:05.780
<b>This way!</b>

04:15.040 --> 04:18.000
<b>Some people’s natural talents
are heightened through XM exposure.</b>

04:18.090 --> 04:19.880
<b>They're called Sensitives.</b>

04:20.630 --> 04:21.970
<b>And this guy’s one of ‘em?</b>

04:22.840 --> 04:23.680
<b>I’m one, too.</b>

04:24.470 --> 04:26.220
<b>Each Sensitive has different abilities.</b>

04:26.970 --> 04:29.640
<b>My ability allows me to see the invisible.</b>

04:30.930 --> 04:32.100
<b>So the guy chasing us...</b>

04:36.020 --> 04:36.900
<b>Oh, come on!</b>

04:46.070 --> 04:46.910
<b>Sarah!</b>

05:06.340 --> 05:07.180
<b>Wait!</b>

05:07.640 --> 05:08.470
<b>Up there!</b>

05:28.320 --> 05:31.240
<b>Alpha, follow after the targets.
Get a sniper ready.</b>

05:31.910 --> 05:34.080
<b>Bravo, take down
that Resistance Field, now!</b>

05:34.160 --> 05:35.750
<b><i>Copy that.</i></b>

05:39.170 --> 05:42.800
<b><i>Jack Norman. Brandt’s guard.</i>
<i>Resistance. I’ve read your file.</i></b>

05:45.550 --> 05:49.510
<b><i>XM let’s you "Flash Forward."</i>
<i>See future possibilities.</i></b>

05:56.890 --> 05:58.350
<b>He’s reading our moves, I knew it!</b>

06:00.900 --> 06:01.730
<b>Reading us?</b>

06:01.810 --> 06:04.650
<b>Yeah. It has to be his Sensitive ability.</b>

06:04.730 --> 06:06.610
<b>Damn. I gotta tell the inspector...</b>

06:06.690 --> 06:07.860
<b><i>You have insufficient time.</i></b>

06:09.410 --> 06:10.700
<b>YOU HAVE INSUFFICIENT TIME.</b>

06:10.780 --> 06:11.620
<b>Ingress...</b>

06:12.120 --> 06:13.330
<b>-You know it?
-Yeah...</b>

06:14.660 --> 06:16.410
<b>It installed all by itself.</b>

06:16.500 --> 06:19.750
<b>Then soon after someone contacted me.
Told me to help you.</b>

06:20.710 --> 06:23.250
<b><i>The world is in danger.</i></b>

06:24.250 --> 06:27.260
<b><i>Many forces seek to harness</i>
<i>the power of XM.</i></b>

06:28.380 --> 06:31.220
<b><i>Those forces are split into two Factions,</i>
<i>which are in conflict.</i></b>

06:32.100 --> 06:35.260
<b><i>The man tracking you is of the Resistance.</i>
<i>Their Portals enable his power.</i></b>

06:36.060 --> 06:36.890
<b>What Portals?</b>

06:37.350 --> 06:39.230
<b>XM enters our universe from them.</b>

06:40.850 --> 06:41.690
<b>Look.</b>

06:44.190 --> 06:45.270
<b>This is a Portal.</b>

06:47.110 --> 06:50.200
<b><i>Your current location is surrounded</i>
<i>by Resistance-controlled Portals.</i></b>

06:51.110 --> 06:54.370
<b><i>Those Portals unlock and feed</i>
<i>his Sensitive abilities.</i></b>

06:56.740 --> 06:59.540
<b>What am I supposed to do?
He has us cornered.</b>

07:00.670 --> 07:02.210
<b><i>You must choose a Faction.</i></b>

07:02.830 --> 07:06.130
<b><i>They hold each other in balance.</i>
<i>This choice is yours alone.</i></b>

07:15.260 --> 07:18.220
<b><i>You have joined the Enlightened.</i></b>

07:31.780 --> 07:33.320
<b>I-It’s done! Now what?</b>

07:33.610 --> 07:38.080
<b><i>Use an XMP Burster</i>
<i>to attack the Resistance Portals.</i></b>

07:38.160 --> 07:39.000
<b>Like this?</b>

07:46.420 --> 07:47.250
<b>Look! It’s working!</b>

07:47.800 --> 07:49.090
<b>But nothing’s happening!</b>

07:49.170 --> 07:51.630
<b>Just trust me on this!
You’ve gotta keep going!</b>

07:52.340 --> 07:53.590
<b>O-Okay!</b>

08:01.640 --> 08:03.310
<b>Keep going. You’ve got this!</b>

08:03.690 --> 08:04.560
<b>That's enough!</b>

08:07.900 --> 08:08.860
<b>No more hide and seek.</b>

08:11.820 --> 08:14.490
<b><i>This is Bravo.</i>
<i>We’re ready to destroy the Links.</i></b>

08:14.570 --> 08:16.240
<b><i>Attacking Resistance Portal now.</i></b>

08:16.660 --> 08:19.080
<b>Hey, any idea who fired
those Bursters earlier?</b>

08:19.580 --> 08:22.790
<b>Don’t ask me. Makes our job easier though.
Hurry and take down the Links.</b>

08:27.710 --> 08:29.750
<b>You still haven’t answered my question.</b>

08:30.710 --> 08:32.300
<b>What do you want with Sarah?</b>

08:33.170 --> 08:37.970
<b><i>Portal Links destroyed.</i>
<i>Control Field destabilized.</i></b>

08:43.560 --> 08:44.690
<b>They’re working with you?</b>

08:45.520 --> 08:46.730
<b>Makoto! The Burster!</b>

08:47.770 --> 08:48.610
<b>Right!</b>

09:03.370 --> 09:04.290
<b>We gotta go!</b>

09:06.750 --> 09:07.580
<b>Sarah!</b>

09:27.690 --> 09:28.520
<b>Damn!</b>

09:35.400 --> 09:36.530
<b>All right. We’re moving!</b>

09:37.070 --> 09:37.910
<b>Makoto!</b>

09:41.580 --> 09:42.490
<b>This guy’s insane!</b>

10:05.850 --> 10:07.560
<b>Time to get the hell out of Dodge.</b>

10:11.730 --> 10:12.820
<b>No more excuses.</b>

10:12.900 --> 10:15.650
<b>If you lost him, find him!
And get rid of him.</b>

10:16.360 --> 10:17.650
<b><i>And the other two?</i></b>

10:18.030 --> 10:19.700
<b>I’ll deal with them.</b>

10:24.790 --> 10:27.330
<b>Sensitives...
I never knew such a thing existed...</b>

10:28.000 --> 10:30.670
<b>XM is full of powerful mysteries.</b>

10:45.350 --> 10:48.770
<b>We’re in way over our heads.
We need to go to the police.</b>

10:50.650 --> 10:51.770
<b>I know they’ll help us.</b>

10:52.810 --> 10:53.650
<b>Fine.</b>

10:59.780 --> 11:00.610
<b>Come on...</b>

11:01.910 --> 11:04.240
<b><i>Turn back.</i>
<i>The police have been compromised.</i></b>

11:04.580 --> 11:06.450
<b>Huh?! What are you talking about?</b>

11:07.240 --> 11:09.160
<b><i>This communication is unstable--</i></b>

11:09.250 --> 11:10.080
<b>H-Hey!</b>

11:19.470 --> 11:21.300
<b>Eyes on the suspect.
Requesting backup.</b>

11:24.220 --> 11:25.640
<b>You there!</b>

11:29.680 --> 11:30.520
<b>Just a minute!</b>

11:32.940 --> 11:35.520
<b><i>A person of interest</i>
<i>in the Hulong Lab explosion</i></b>

11:35.610 --> 11:37.110
<b><i>has been reported kidnapped.</i></b>

11:37.190 --> 11:39.690
<b><i>The kidnapping victim is a foreign female</i>
<i>in her mid-twenties.</i></b>

11:39.780 --> 11:42.780
<b><i>The primary suspect is Makoto Midorikawa.</i></b>

11:42.860 --> 11:43.700
<b><i>I repeat...</i></b>

11:44.280 --> 11:45.120
<b>That’s our guy?</b>

11:45.530 --> 11:48.700
<b>We were seriously contracting a kidnapper!
Makes us look great...</b>

11:49.200 --> 11:50.910
<b>Media’s going to have a damn field day...</b>

11:51.500 --> 11:53.370
<b>Things will get messy
once the word spreads.</b>

11:53.870 --> 11:55.540
<b>Especially for us, Inspector.</b>

11:58.250 --> 11:59.300
<b>Makoto...</b>

12:10.220 --> 12:11.640
<b>What the hell is going on?</b>

12:12.600 --> 12:15.520
<b>HULONG EXPLOSION WITNESS KIDNAPPED
BY POLICE INVESTIGATOR.</b>

12:15.860 --> 12:17.570
<b>They think I’m a kidnapper. Seriously?</b>

12:18.900 --> 12:21.530
<b>I’m sorry I got you involved.</b>

12:22.860 --> 12:27.620
<b>Hulong's a powerful organization,
but I didn’t know they control the police.</b>

12:37.920 --> 12:41.210
<b>I tried to uncover some of
their horrible secrets.</b>

12:43.170 --> 12:46.470
<b>As long as you’re with me,
you’ll be in danger.</b>

12:49.470 --> 12:52.520
<b>I don’t want you to get hurt, so...
Thanks for everything.</b>

12:54.810 --> 12:55.730
<b>Whoa, hang on.</b>

12:56.900 --> 12:58.810
<b>For better or worse,
we’re in this together.</b>

13:00.070 --> 13:02.610
<b>Besides, I’m a wanted man, remember?</b>

13:04.200 --> 13:05.030
<b>You can’t...</b>

13:06.910 --> 13:10.370
<b>We’re a team, Sarah.
We can find a way to stop them.</b>

13:13.330 --> 13:15.660
<b>They’re pulling out all the stops
to find you.</b>

13:16.620 --> 13:19.000
<b>Whatever it is you know
must be pretty important.</b>

13:21.170 --> 13:24.670
<b>Important enough to hurt them...
if you can remember.</b>

13:34.520 --> 13:35.560
<b>I can’t remember.</b>

13:36.690 --> 13:37.520
<b>Sarah?</b>

13:38.650 --> 13:42.110
<b>My memories from before
the explosion... are fragments.</b>

13:44.860 --> 13:45.690
<b>Memories...</b>

13:47.400 --> 13:49.070
<b>What’s his deal?</b>

13:49.570 --> 13:51.490
<b>-Weirdo!
-Don't get too close...</b>

13:52.700 --> 13:53.540
<b>No!</b>

13:55.120 --> 13:57.250
<b>He sees my memories...</b>

14:03.920 --> 14:04.760
<b>Makoto?</b>

14:06.840 --> 14:08.180
<b>I have something to say, Sarah.</b>

14:09.340 --> 14:10.180
<b>I think I can help.</b>

14:13.430 --> 14:14.270
<b>Memories?!</b>

14:14.600 --> 14:16.850
<b>Well, it’s not like I’m
a mind-reader or anything.</b>

14:16.930 --> 14:19.690
<b>But, I see the past through objects
that were there.</b>

14:20.940 --> 14:21.770
<b>Like your ring...</b>

14:22.770 --> 14:25.360
<b>If I look, I might see things
that you don’t want me to.</b>

14:27.190 --> 14:28.030
<b>Just do it.</b>

14:32.740 --> 14:33.580
<b>Shall we?</b>

14:50.800 --> 14:53.510
<b>Walk with me toward the truth
of this world.</b>

14:58.230 --> 15:01.150
<b>No!</b>

15:02.770 --> 15:05.820
<b>No, further back...
before the explosion!</b>

15:29.420 --> 15:31.300
<b><i>This is what they were after...</i></b>

15:32.840 --> 15:34.550
<b><i>Everything was leading to this...</i></b>

15:38.220 --> 15:39.060
<b><i>I need this data!</i></b>

15:48.150 --> 15:49.150
<b><i>This place!</i></b>

16:03.750 --> 16:04.630
<b>Seriously?</b>

16:06.210 --> 16:08.630
<b>They said the unauthorized access
came from this terminal.</b>

16:08.710 --> 16:12.220
<b>How? They would have had
to get past security. Unless...</b>

16:12.470 --> 16:15.340
<b>We’ve got a security leak.
Split up and find them.</b>

16:20.890 --> 16:21.730
<b>Hey!</b>

16:23.850 --> 16:26.060
<b>Spread out! She’s in here somewhere!</b>

16:32.320 --> 16:33.950
<b>Anybody out there...</b>

16:35.860 --> 16:37.410
<b>THE WORLD IS IN DANGER!</b>

16:38.120 --> 16:39.540
<b>Found her! You! Stay where you are!</b>

16:44.420 --> 16:45.290
<b>I’ve got her!</b>

16:48.500 --> 16:50.590
<b><i>I have to send this message.</i></b>

16:52.260 --> 16:53.090
<b><i>Please! Don’t!</i></b>

17:01.890 --> 17:04.060
<b>Makoto. What did you see?</b>

17:05.190 --> 17:08.520
<b>They were... working on some sort
of top secret project.</b>

17:09.650 --> 17:11.280
<b>You learned something terrifying about it.</b>

17:13.110 --> 17:17.160
<b>The last thing you saw was a laboratory.
It looked like it was in a forest...</b>

17:18.120 --> 17:19.120
<b>Do you remember that?</b>

17:40.510 --> 17:41.680
<b>S-Sarah?</b>

17:48.350 --> 17:49.400
<b>Hold on!</b>

18:13.750 --> 18:14.590
<b>What is...</b>

18:16.420 --> 18:17.340
<b>It’s here.</b>

18:22.390 --> 18:25.720
<b>This is where the project started.</b>

18:54.340 --> 18:55.170
<b>It’s happening again.</b>

18:56.380 --> 18:57.210
<b>You can see it too?</b>

18:57.920 --> 19:00.090
<b>The energy? I can see it right now!</b>

19:07.140 --> 19:10.480
<b>Someone is helping them.
We need to find out who.</b>

19:11.520 --> 19:13.310
<b>We couldn't trace their signal, sir.</b>

19:13.900 --> 19:14.730
<b>Idiots.</b>

19:15.400 --> 19:17.650
<b>We’ve got a GPS lock on the Japanese guy.</b>

19:17.730 --> 19:18.570
<b>Continue.</b>

19:19.150 --> 19:22.030
<b>Seems to be in a vehicle
heading toward Tokyo Station, sir.</b>

19:22.610 --> 19:23.740
<b>The train station?</b>

19:32.500 --> 19:36.340
<b>Our Kyoto facility.
Get a squad out there now.</b>

19:36.420 --> 19:38.380
<b>What about the Resistance Agent?</b>

19:38.460 --> 19:42.550
<b>We have to secure the test subject.
She’s our priority.</b>

19:42.630 --> 19:43.470
<b>Yes sir!</b>

19:54.020 --> 19:54.860
<b>Kyoto, huh?</b>

20:10.330 --> 20:14.370
<b><i>This is the Nozomi Super Express,</i>
<i>headed for Shin-Osaka.</i></b>

20:14.460 --> 20:16.380
<b>Whew. We didn’t miss it!</b>

20:16.460 --> 20:23.430
<b><i>This train stops at Shinagawa,</i>
<i>Shin-Yokohama, Nagoya, and Kyoto.</i></b>

20:24.800 --> 20:25.890
<b><i>Non-reserved seats--</i></b>

20:31.930 --> 20:33.730
<b>It'll be nice to finally get
a bit of rest.</b>

20:49.490 --> 20:52.790
<b>You said you’ve seen it?
The hidden energy I see.</b>

20:58.960 --> 20:59.960
<b>You’re a Sensitive.</b>

21:05.720 --> 21:06.640
<b>A Sensitive...</b>

21:08.050 --> 21:12.890
<b><i>Nozomi Super Express headed for Shin-Osaka</i>
<i>is now departing.</i></b>

22:54.950 --> 22:56.950
<b>Subtitle Translation by Rika Takahashi</b>
